sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Sequência UML - Fluxo de Check-in e Sincronização Interserviços

    actor Receptionist as Recepcionista
    participant MFE as Microfrontend React
    participant BFF as BFF NestJS
    participant APIM as API Gateway (APIM)
    participant Res as Reservas Service (SQL)
    participant SQL as Azure SQL Database
    participant Worker as Outbox Worker
    participant Bus as Azure Service Bus
    participant Hotel as Hotel Service (Mongo)
    participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas

    Receptionist->>MFE: Clica em "Realizar Check-in" (Reserva #RES-501)
    MFE->>BFF: POST /api/v1/reservations/RES-501/checkin
    activate BFF

    BFF->>APIM: POST /api/v1/reservations/RES-501/checkin
    APIM->>Res: POST /internal/reservations/RES-501/checkin
    activate Res

    Res->>SQL: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Res->>SQL: SELECT Status, RoomId, CheckInDate FROM Reservations WHERE Id = 'RES-501'
    Note over Res: Valida se reserva está CONFIRMED e se data de check-in é válida hoje
    Res->>SQL: UPDATE Reservations SET Status = 'ACTIVE', ActualCheckInAt = GETUTCDATE() WHERE Id = 'RES-501'
    Res->>SQL: INSERT INTO Outbox (EventType = 'CheckInCompleted', AggregateId = 'RES-501', Payload = { roomId: 'R201', guestId: 'G10' })
    Res->>SQL: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    Res-->>APIM: 200 OK { id: "RES-501", status: "ACTIVE", roomId: "R201" }
    deactivate Res
    APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK
    BFF-->>MFE: 200 OK { message: "Check-in realizado com sucesso", status: "ACTIVE" }
    deactivate BFF
    MFE-->>Receptionist: Exibe Toast de confirmação e atualiza quarto localmente para "Ocupado"

    %% Propagação Assíncrona via EDA
    Worker->>SQL: SELECT * FROM Outbox WHERE Status = 'PENDING'
    Worker->>Bus: Publish Topic "reservation-events" (CheckInCompleted)
    Worker->>SQL: UPDATE Outbox SET Status = 'PUBLISHED' WHERE Id = ...

    Bus->>Hotel: Consume Subscription "hotel-room-status-sync"
    activate Hotel
    Hotel->>Mongo: updateOne({ id: 'R201' }, { $set: { status: 'occupied', currentReservationId: 'RES-501' } })
    Note over Hotel,Mongo: Status físico do quarto atualizado para "occupied" no MongoDB Atlas
    deactivate Hotel
